</aside>
<div class="shell">
  <header><div class="header-left"><a class="new-chat-link" href="/dms?new=1"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3v10M3 8h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>New DM</a><span class="header-context"></span></div><div class="header-right"><a class="node-link" href="/?view=nodes"><span class="node-indicator" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local</a></div></header>
  <div class="body-grid "><main><span class='eyebrow'>KNOWLEDGE</span><h2>Review knowledge</h2><p class='muted'>Check the evidence before accepting a claim.</p><article class='record'><span class='tag'>pending</span><h3>Pending &lt;claim&gt;</h3><dl><dt>Evidence</dt><dd>Logs &amp; traces</dd><dt>Scope</dt><dd>Node</dd><dt>Recheck when</dt><dd>Weekly</dd></dl><form method='post' action='/review' class='actions'><input type='hidden' name='id' value='0'><button class='primary' name='decision' value='accepted'>Accept entry</button><button name='decision' value='rejected'>Reject</button></form></article><article class='record'><span class='tag'>accepted</span><h3>Accepted claim</h3><dl><dt>Evidence</dt><dd>Tests</dd><dt>Scope</dt><dd>All</dd><dt>Recheck when</dt><dd>Never</dd></dl></article><h3 class='form-title'>New entry</h3><form method='post' action='/propose'><label>Claim · up to 280 characters<input name='claim' required maxlength='280'></label><label>Evidence or source<input name='evidence' required maxlength='1000'></label><label>Scope<input name='scope' required maxlength='300'></label><label>Recheck when<input name='validity' required maxlength='300'></label><button class='primary'>Submit for review ↗</button></form><div class="bottom-note"><span>⌘ CONTROL</span></div></main></div>
</div>
</body></html>
